 "titulo": "How medieval monks treated strangers 🍞 Part 3 #history #shorts",
 "capa": "EVERY GUEST IS CHRIST",
 "descripcion": "A soaked pilgrim knocks at midnight. The monks wash his feet, feed him, and eat in silence. The end of You Wake Up in a Monastery, 1200.\n\nSources: Rule of Saint Benedict, chapters 38, 39, 40, 42 and 53.\n\nWould you trade your life for this one?\n\n#history #medieval #middleages #historyfacts #shorts",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Someone is pounding on the gate, in the snow.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "It's a pilgrim. Soaked, shaking, on his way to Rome.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Your rule says every guest is welcomed like Christ himself.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "So the abbot wakes up, and the monks wash the stranger's feet.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He gets a bed, a blanket, and a seat at your table.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The next day, he sees how you eat. In silence.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "One monk reads aloud while everyone else eats. Nobody talks.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Each of you gets about a pound of bread a day.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Two cooked dishes, beans or eggs or fish, and a small cup of wine.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "No meat from four legged animals. Only the sick get that.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The pilgrim leaves warm, fed, with bread for the road.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "And you go back to your desk by the window.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Day after day. Season after season. Page after page.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "One evening, a year later, you write the last word.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Hundreds of pages, in your own hand.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then the bell rings for the last prayer of the day.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "After that comes the great silence. Not a word, until morning.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Would you trade your life for this one?",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
